      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present an interesting radiologic finding in a 65-year-old gentleman who attended our emergency department (ED)with sudden-onset severe abdominal pain. Non\u2013contrast-enhanced computed tomography of the abdomen revealed a 7-cm abdominal aortic aneurysm (AAA)which demonstrated the high-attenuation crescent sign (HACS)."},
